(BackupCommandTests.vb), asserting BackupOutcome.Succeeded but getting
Partial: "no ready volume labelled 'MERCHBACKUP' is attached". Confirmed
via Get-Volume that no USB drive is attached to this machine at all right
now. This is P1-17's off-host-copy precondition, unrelated to identity
schema work - 0005_identity and 0007 touch neither BackupLogs nor any
backup code path. All 61 other integration tests pass, including the full
MigrationRunnerTests suite (5 tests) against the real runner mechanism, so
this migration introduces no regression. Re-run with a MERCHBACKUP USB
drive attached to get a fully green suite; not re-run here because that
precondition is out of this card's scope.

